        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/97bad568cd2c97bd586211d6bba0c5e7.avif?t=1789037049\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Hercules on a time-management adventure! Gather resources, rebuild frozen lands, and outsmart Pandora's icy curse before winter swallows Hellas whole. With plenty of challenging levels, multiple difficulty modes, and powerful boosts, your hero's journey through myth and mayhem begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/8bbd1dd1c8431b8d3a57ec2b8b488b95.avif?t=1789037049\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sunlit lands of Hellas, Hercules was enjoying a rare moment of peace - relaxing in his favorite hammock with a refreshing drink in hand. But fate has a habit of interrupting even the calmest days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/e366f76947a6e0334be3335bc3f67ca0.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unfortunate mistake, Hercules found himself in a strange place, holding the mysterious Pandora's Box. When he returned to Hellas and opened it, icy winds burst forth, blanketing the once-warm lands in frost and snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/e2105b4acea4d19d1dcab09e68150ad8.avif?t=1789037049\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the mighty Hercules must embark on a frosty new adventure to set things right! Help him rescue the radiant goddess Eos, restore warmth to the world, and banish the eternal winter before it's too late. Journey through dazzling snowy landscapes, meet quirky and charming characters, and face challenges filled with both danger and delight. From icy puzzles to festive surprises, each level brings new tasks that will test your wit and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/1bb7b521db83b741c7eab4b2700ddfb0.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Hercules break the curse of eternal winter? Play &quot;12 Labours of Hercules XIX: Pandora's Gift Box&quot; and bring sunshine back to Hellas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/2d8aa0aacab5957f3851fd1c014da200.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover Pandora's curse in a playful Greek myth adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore frozen landscapes filled with challenges and winter fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming characters and enjoy festive frosty mischief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try a new Game Speed with Hercules by your side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with obstacles, bonus, and super bonus levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey amidst breathtaking HD visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle snow and frost, juggle tasks, be the hero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/4733400fda95a2d8d4527211198aaf0a.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player games</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/97bad568cd2c97bd586211d6bba0c5e7.avif?t=1789037049\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Hercules on a time-management adventure! Gather resources, rebuild frozen lands, and outsmart Pandora's icy curse before winter swallows Hellas whole. With plenty of challenging levels, multiple difficulty modes, and powerful boosts, your hero's journey through myth and mayhem begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/8bbd1dd1c8431b8d3a57ec2b8b488b95.avif?t=1789037049\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sunlit lands of Hellas, Hercules was enjoying a rare moment of peace - relaxing in his favorite hammock with a refreshing drink in hand. But fate has a habit of interrupting even the calmest days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/e366f76947a6e0334be3335bc3f67ca0.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unfortunate mistake, Hercules found himself in a strange place, holding the mysterious Pandora's Box. When he returned to Hellas and opened it, icy winds burst forth, blanketing the once-warm lands in frost and snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/e2105b4acea4d19d1dcab09e68150ad8.avif?t=1789037049\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the mighty Hercules must embark on a frosty new adventure to set things right! Help him rescue the radiant goddess Eos, restore warmth to the world, and banish the eternal winter before it's too late. Journey through dazzling snowy landscapes, meet quirky and charming characters, and face challenges filled with both danger and delight. From icy puzzles to festive surprises, each level brings new tasks that will test your wit and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/1bb7b521db83b741c7eab4b2700ddfb0.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Hercules break the curse of eternal winter? Play &quot;12 Labours of Hercules XIX: Pandora's Gift Box&quot; and bring sunshine back to Hellas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/2d8aa0aacab5957f3851fd1c014da200.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover Pandora's curse in a playful Greek myth adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore frozen landscapes filled with challenges and winter fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming characters and enjoy festive frosty mischief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try a new Game Speed with Hercules by your side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with obstacles, bonus, and super bonus levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey amidst breathtaking HD visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle snow and frost, juggle tasks, be the hero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167560/extras/4733400fda95a2d8d4527211198aaf0a.avif?t=1789037049\" width=590 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player games</p></li></ul>",
